- **Claude in CI**: `claude.yml` answers `@claude` in a comment on a **plain issue** only — never a pull request, never an issue labelled `dependabot-alert` or `weekly-digest` — with the job token as its only GitHub credential. Private repositories only. A change to the file updates the digest in `scripts/guards.d/44-claude-ci.sh` (CC-1..4) and is merged by hand, like any `claude/issue-*` branch. → `docs/conventions/claude-ci.md`
